  },
  {
   "i": 1078,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1087,
   "src": "19255e84637d",
   "t": "What a splendid ring, though."
  },
  {
